#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:5
#: 39b6c98260684d188b23884ef90d2511 581271bbaefe4311bee2261aeac5e12d
#: 697a7b8f29f94ab2a1a11be091ea6903 bc2b110d40ce444d8ff7bafa3ef6fa3e
#: ebc8b9eca91440fb8d5c29fa04b7b1aa
msgid "LightWare SF45/B 350 Lidar"
msgstr "LightWare SF45/B 350 激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:7
#: 4d6ebb5c36fb433ea7bb3f27bff3e28a 73b405bc789b477e9113de631b426637
#: 795f95be3e414cca98ba3c5299389e91 c4d0a9e9afb042d4a4dc97638e52c386
#: ea8a1d142fb64daa9beb918eaa25c981
msgid ""
"The `Lightware SF45/B lidar <https://lightwarelidar.com/collections/lidar-"
"rangefinders/products/copy-of-sf45-b-50m>`__ is a small (about 50g) scanning"
" lidar (up to 350 deg) with a 50m range"
msgstr ""
"`Lightware SF45/B 激光雷达 <https://lightwarelidar.com/collections/lidar-"
"rangefinders/products/copy-of-sf45-b-50m>`__ 是一款小巧（约 50g）的扫描激光雷达（最大 350 "
"度），测距范围 50m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:14
#: 12de2b2c534d4c21b1b9bc642ddbbd31 1daeeb542ee042d2be57279b4c907e0c
#: 4b81658baf6443ae969b3b46a357d1ba 7af4f08532da463589b548e62cbf5a9b
#: af24f33abadf412cbe1da16a2e59167b
msgid "Mounting the SF45/B"
msgstr "安装 SF45/B"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:16
#: 392a581b916b42319e34d64b7188781b 49de04a405d74959b60a814ddc88a2fb
#: 8bc4d1a74560400e885cdb5f851059ce 9af1396a89cb46f88493342cce5e2583
#: f1d3d9b225234bc8a3b0cc768d96ee35
msgid ""
"The SF45/B should be mounted on the top or bottom of the vehicle so that the"
" lidar scans horizontally.  Ideally the number of vehicle parts (GPS mast, "
"vehicle legs, etc) that obstruct the lidar's view should be reduced to a "
"minimum"
msgstr "SF45/B 应安装在飞行器顶部或底部，使激光雷达水平扫描。理想情况下，遮挡激光雷达视野的飞行器部件（GPS 桅杆、支腿等）应减少到最少"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:19
#: 1c034e8a61194e2fa19f9b30a8fe5fbf 28a11c57cdd949e1b9d4bb41bb9144b8
#: d4c16af2aef24aa582ae8163dbb5235f e2b3a7c6431c4e78b28e4674df238f32
#: f69d3d64272645d68e49d48421e7e551
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:24
#: 4f6850115b074b45a0a1d7ec0e34c28d 8dcde1b53970481ea1e3aeb12d1dc974
#: d8707013861b4ebdaad6d019887cc31d ea146efc349b4e849eb0b2351fe0a58e
#: f65d423453e542e584f81e2851a47e85
msgid ""
"The lidar can be connected to any serial port but if powering the sensor "
"directly from the autopilot (i.e without a BEC) ensure the port can provide "
"the required 300mW of current.  Many Pixhawk compatible autopilots can "
"provide more power to Serial1 than other ports meaning this may be the best "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"激光雷达可连接到任何串口，但如果直接从飞控供电（即不使用 BEC），请确保该端口能提供所需的 300mW 电流。许多 Pixhawk 兼容飞控可向 "
"Serial1 提供比其他端口更多的功率，因此这可能是最佳选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:27
#: 39059f31872a495e81a067434c7cf9b1 51f8e2a74946414a8d6f3831bfa9d1dd
#: 6b14f815f5fc406192061d04dc70c68c c0775d6ffd7748ab9a72c36c456d1d87
#: db0b7654b29c4168b9819a77ebd2a64d
msgid "Configuration through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:28
#: 416bbe9569ed4a46a20ece8a95d2615a 44d599095b744049ac63fdf9ee1cf97c
#: 53c794e7801a416f845f949e3e3a43fb 634f50e614b54b92b16edb9b0ef92b87
#: d6786e43d072443bb3662b5e52244332
msgid "Example setup below shown for first proximity sensor:"
msgstr "以下为第一个近距传感器的设置示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:30
#: 209f3a02deab43e88dde8a2e3b5c1230 2713d09dae5a457cbdb7e161ad1a6228
#: 295f2a30fcc84c55bcf9be1cf197ef12 414f058a540646ce918745dc71aef6ff
#: 9fe77f01e2bb4d8a9a12ef28d86bf300
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = \"11\" (\"Lidar360\") if using "
"Serial1"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 「11」（「Lidar360」），如果使用 Serial1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:31
#: 268d3ff211da4ce79ee86a3b5c5c9682 39a0d4d3e4f14347b9864fb73256f502
#: 57c843c53e3d4b1d9619a6a3e4a2d816 beb3f61799784331b542c4b59abfd12b
#: e6dead8992d6419bb514d1c48a4074b6
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` =  \"115\" if using Serial1"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 「115」，如果使用 Serial1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:32
#: 8f92616eb45d40c79d3afe6f913981bd 9dad9c89fa92421299e61603bea25c51
#: bf4259f259e748be8e0ef3b2d14ddbf3 c46e549b86fb469a80bf50248884a9b2
#: e079c856649c4a69b8444390c32e2aac
msgid ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = \"8\" (LightwareSF45B)"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 「8」（LightwareSF45B）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:33
#: 04ddb0545f5741e387e1a8ad979c4f2d 0d7b31398bb84c1ca00849554bea0ff5
#: 11b1a6e91f7f4f3c8a99ca7341515638 127fa4f8813941f6a5f09ebc638e5bfd
#: 6c81041d5c294d41bf4e3d708f9af123
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = \"0\" if mounted on the top of the "
"vehicle, \"1\" if mounted upside-down on the bottom of the vehicle"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = 「0」，如果安装在飞行器顶部；「1」，如果倒置安装在飞行器底部"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:34
#: 5403d2926cd94a4892587f1413cc9ba4 c035f8a515ff4769b6bed85b7034b44f
#: dc0285c76ff6440eb6c9b7e87306fecd e57c7bf032de4a2c98b6c5cd5c7d303e
#: e8219915d4ea4a6581d738a96fc0477d
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_YAW_CORR <PRX1_YAW_CORR>` allows adjusting for the forward "
"direction of the lidar.  For example, if the lidar is facing forward this "
"parameter can be left as 0.  If facing backwards it should be set to 180."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PRX1_YAW_CORR <PRX1_YAW_CORR>` 允许调整激光雷达的前向方向。例如，如果激光雷达朝向前方，该参数可保持为 "
"0；如果朝向后方，应设为 180。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:35
#: 4517e5c641074400974cb7b5cab63d00 5c0944893063422887d8000141dc1fe0
#: 8cf25a13cd904d72859ce4d478774e83 c0b44a4a04834714b90126b857ef7be0
#: f88b3d45107147f2a0afd91ebb1fa0de
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` and :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 "
"<PRX1_IGN_WID1>` parameters allow defining zones around the vehicle that "
"should be ignored.  For example to avoid a 20deg area to the right, set "
":ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` to 90 and :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 "
"<PRX1_IGN_WID1>` to 20."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` 和 :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 <PRX1_IGN_WID1>` "
"参数允许定义应被忽略的飞行器周围区域。例如，要忽略右侧 20 度区域，将 :ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` 设为"
" 90，将 :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 <PRX1_IGN_WID1>` 设为 20。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf45b.rst:37
#: 01270748741f4fa88181f8655f0d4cb4 386358e6edf64b33bc2ffa7e11783ff8
#: 751e44e882254f2f87bb3703544240b3 9ea87afec4694e409a06fd5e9d023017
#: ca3a6d1dae3b45a5bb71ca279ae12488
msgid ""
"More details on using this sensor for object avoidance on Copter can be "
"found :ref:`here <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"有关在 Copter 上使用此传感器进行避障的更多详情，请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`。"

